{"4485340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lock & Stone", "steam_appid": 4485340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4858160], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lock &amp; Stone is a Metroidbrainia</strong>, with secrets locked away behind hidden information and puzzles knowledge. Direhold itself is a puzzle to solve. Exploring pathways, understanding the environment, and learning about the lore will allow you to access its secrets.<br><br>Survive the lost dwarven city of Direhold, a labyrinth locked by esoteric runes and haunted by sinister creatures. In<strong> Lock &amp; Stone</strong>, you must combine puzzle-solving deduction skills with survival-horror combat prowess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncovering information or obtaining powers can unlock new areas or reach items back where you previously explored. There are always more secrets to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485340/extras/f49e115faeabf0b465ade249ef52f4de.poster.avif?t=1785345911\" width=940 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485340/extras/f49e115faeabf0b465ade249ef52f4de.webm?t=1785345911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485340/extras/f49e115faeabf0b465ade249ef52f4de.mp4?t=1785345911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you must use the power of Runes. Each Rune Slate you uncover has a hidden ability that will allow you to survive the dark city. Some slates can allow you to open up locked doors, or blast enemies with flames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485340/extras/21c36ab43b98f4fc4ae05aada833a7ca.poster.avif?t=1785345911\" width=940 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485340/extras/21c36ab43b98f4fc4ae05aada833a7ca.webm?t=1785345911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485340/extras/21c36ab43b98f4fc4ae05aada833a7ca.mp4?t=1785345911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the environment for information, decipher the hidden codes, and apply your Rune Slates to access the locks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485340/extras/85d251831018b20c2e921c2bc3ed8920.poster.avif?t=1785345911\" width=940 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485340/extras/85d251831018b20c2e921c2bc3ed8920.webm?t=1785345911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485340/extras/85d251831018b20c2e921c2bc3ed8920.mp4?t=1785345911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lock &amp; Stone is a Metroidbrainia</strong>, with secrets locked away behind hidden information and puzzles knowledge. Direhold itself is a puzzle to solve. Exploring pathways, understanding the environment, and learning about the lore will allow you to access its secrets.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lock &amp; Stone is a Metroidbrainia</strong>, with secrets locked away behind hidden information and puzzles knowledge. Direhold itself is a puzzle to solve. Exploring pathways, understanding the environment, and learning about the lore will allow you to access its secrets.<br><br>Survive the lost dwarven city of Direhold, 